		"description": "<p><em>A 5d12 shadow minion summoned by Eldritch Usurper (1/encounter, instead of your Summon Shadow Shadows).</em></p><p>It follows the minion rules (1 HP, no damage bonus, does not crit) and abandons you immediately outside of combat.</p><p><strong>Death Burst.</strong> When it dies, it explodes into 5 Shadows (ignoring your Shadow Limit). Place them anywhere within Reach 6.</p><p>[A] When it drops to 0 HP it is removed and the 5 Shadows appear around the spot where it fell (move them within Reach 6 by hand).</p>",
